{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026jk9wJYiqfW1794125879.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p><a href=\"https://www.hko.gov.hk/tc/wxinfo/currwx/fnd.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">九天天氣預報</a></p><p></p><p>[18:45]</p><p>天文台：預料本港吹偏北強風。市民應提防海面大浪可能帶來的危險。</p><p></p><p>[11:45]</p><p>特別天氣提示︰受強烈東北季候風影響，預料本港今晚氣溫將進一步下降，明早最低氣溫在16度左右。星期三早上新界仍然清涼，日夜溫差頗大。市民請留意天氣變化，注意保暖，並關顧長者及慢性病患者。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:43:02.863733+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T10:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:15:15.688859+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:39.077963+00:00","content_hash":"1c0d78136c1a77092b438bbd8a9f9d69b01ee1f639d5639025345780733e5d3f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T11:43:02.863733+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}